# Where scripts/qualify-host.mjs writes each measurement it takes. Working
# output, not evidence: the deliberate artifact is the promoted copy under
# evals/live/baseline/, which stays tracked and is committed on purpose. Leaving
# this untracked cost real time -- in this harness a dirty tree is what makes
# task verification report a scope violation, and a measurement is exactly the
# kind of thing that gets run in the middle of one.
evals/qualification/
